 {r}←Make flag;flag2;answer;q;M;noOf;C;path;parms;zipFilename;cfg
⍝ "Make"s this project. Does nothing when `flag` is 0.
⍝ The function checks whether MakeHelpers is available in `⎕SE`.
⍝ If it is, the user is asked whether to use that one.
⍝ If the user declines, or if it's not available in `⎕SE`, then the function
⍝ attempts to load the package into `⎕SE` with `⎕SE.Tatin.LoadPackages`.
⍝ Returns 1 in case a new version was created and 0 otherwise.
 r←0
 :If flag
     :Section  ⍝ Establish ref to "MakeHelpers"
         :If 9=⎕SE.⎕NC'MakeHelpers'
             flag2←¯1
             :Repeat
                 answer←⍞,0/⍞←q←'Do you want to use "MakeHelpers" ',⎕SE.MakeHelpers.Version,' in ⎕SE (n=re-load) (Y/n)?'
                 answer←(≢q)↓answer
                 :If 0=≢answer
                 :OrIf 'Yy'∊⍨¯1↑answer
                     flag2←1
                 :ElseIf 'Nn'∊⍨¯1↑answer
                     flag2←0
                 :EndIf
             :Until flag2∊0 1
             :If flag2
                 M←⎕SE.MakeHelpers
             :Else
                 noOf←⎕SE.Tatin.LoadPackages'aplteam-MakeHelpers'⎕SE
                 'Could not load the package "aplteam-MakeHelpers"'⎕SIGNAL 6/⍨0=noOf
                 M←⎕SE.MakeHelpers
             :EndIf
         :Else
             noOf←⎕SE.Tatin.LoadPackages'aplteam-MakeHelpers'⎕SE
             'Could not load the package "aplteam-MakeHelpers"'⎕SIGNAL 6/⍨0=noOf
             M←⎕SE.MakeHelpers
         :EndIf
     :EndSection
     ⎕←'Using "MakeHelpers" version ',M.Version
     C←##.CiderConfig
     :If ⎕NULL≡cfg←M.EditPackageConfigFile ##.TatinVars
         ⎕←'Cancelled by user' ⋄ →0
     :EndIf
     path←C.HOME,'/',C.CIDER.distributionFolder
     M.RecreateFolder path
     {}⎕SE.Tatin.CreateAPIfromCFG ##.HashPasswords cfg
     parms←⎕SE.Tatin.CreateBuildParms C.HOME
     parms.targetPath←path
     parms.version←cfg.version
     zipFilename←⎕SE.Tatin.BuildPackage parms
     ⎕←'*** New version built successfully:',M.CR,'   ',zipFilename
     r←1
 :EndIf
